The issue is that the type of the elements in the array in `Holding` is specified as `&'a [&'a Test]`, which means that all elements in the array must be the same type. In your case, you're trying to have an array of `&'a Test` where `Test` is a generic type with a different `N` for each element.

One way to solve this is to use a trait object instead of a generic type:

